<!DOCTYPE html>
<html>
<head>
<title>Insurance Claim Form</title>
<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-bottom: 15px; }
  td { padding: 8px 0; }
  .header-title { font-size: 24pt; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .sub-header { font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .section-title { font-size: 12pt; font-weight: bold; margin-top: 20px; margin-bottom: 10px; border-bottom: 1px solid #ccc; padding-bottom: 5px; }
  .form-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .form-row > div { flex: 1; }
  .full-width-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 10px; }
  .signature-line { margin-top: 50px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; }
  .checkbox-group label { margin-right: 15px; }
</style>

<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .header-logo {
    float: right;
    font-size: 24px;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, sans-serif;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .signature-line {
    margin-top: 40px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }
  .signature-box {
    width: 45%;
    border-top: 1px solid #000;
    padding-top: 5px;
    text-align: center;
  }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 15px;
  }
  td {
    padding: 8px 0;
    vertical-align: top;
  }
  .contact-info {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    margin-top: 30px;
    font-size: 12px;
  }
  .contact-box {
    width: 48%;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div style="font-size: 18pt; font-weight: bold;">Sun Life Assurance Company of Canada</div>
    <div style="font-size: 20pt; font-weight: bold;">Sun Life</div>
  </div>
  <div style="font-size: 14pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">Disability Claim Statement - Employee</div>

  <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
    <div style="font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 5px;">Claim is for:</div>
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 30px;">
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Short-Term Disability</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Long-Term Disability</label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Instructions</div>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt;">Please submit a disability claim if you have a disability that extends beyond the elimination period that's included in your employer's group policy.</p>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt;">Please complete, sign and date this form, including the medical authorizations, and return it to us along with the following documents (as applicable):</p>
  <ul style="font-size: 11pt; margin-top: 10px;">
    <li>Reimbursement Agreement</li>
    <li>Direct Deposit Authorization</li>
    <li>Third Party Authorization</li>
  </ul>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt;">Be sure to attach a copy of a photo ID (i.e., license or passport).</p>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt;">You may also submit this statement online at <a href="http://www.sunlife.com/us" style="color: blue;">www.sunlife.com/us</a>, click on Submit a Disability Claim. Please send the additional documents by mail or fax:</p>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt;">Mail: <span data-field="mailing_address">{{ mailing_address }}</span></p>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt;">Fax: <span data-field="fax_number">{{ fax_number }}</span></p>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt;">If complete and accurate information is not provided, we may need to request additional information, which could delay your disability benefits.</p>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="section-title">1 General information</div>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td>Name of employee (first, middle initial, last)</td>
      <td><span data-field="employee.full_name">{{ employee.full_name }}</span></td>
      <td>Social Security number</td>
      <td><span data-field="employee.ssn">{{ employee.ssn }}</span></td>
      <td>Date of birth (mm/dd/yyyy)</td>
      <td><span data-field="employee.dob">{{ employee.dob }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>E-mail address*</td>
      <td><span data-field="employee.email">{{ employee.email }}</span></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Street Address</td>
      <td><span data-field="employee.address">{{ employee.address }}</span></td>
      <td>City</td>
      <td><span data-field="employee.city">{{ employee.city }}</span></td>
      <td>State</td>
      <td><span data-field="employee.state">{{ employee.state }}</span></td>
      <td>Zip code</td>
      <td><span data-field="employee.zip_code">{{ employee.zip_code }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Occupation</td>
      <td><span data-field="employee.occupation">{{ employee.occupation }}</span></td>
      <td>Home phone number</td>
      <td><span data-field="employee.home_phone">{{ employee.home_phone }}</span></td>
      <td>Cell phone number</td>
      <td><span data-field="employee.cell_phone">{{ employee.cell_phone }}</span></td>
      <td>Marital status</td>
      <td><span data-field="employee.marital_status">{{ employee.marital_status }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Spouse's name (first, middle initial, last)</td>
      <td><span data-field="spouse.full_name">{{ spouse.full_name }}</span></td>
      <td>Social Security number</td>
      <td><span data-field="spouse.ssn">{{ spouse.ssn }}</span></td>
      <td>Date of birth (mm/dd/yyyy)</td>
      <td><span data-field="spouse.dob">{{ spouse.dob }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p style="font-size: 11pt;">Can we leave you a detailed voicemail if we are unable to reach you by phone?</p>
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 30px;">
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Yes</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> No</label>
    </div>
    <p style="font-size: 11pt;">Is your spouse employed?</p>
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 30px;">
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Yes</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> No</label>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="section-title">2 Information about the condition causing your disability</div>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td>Last day worked (before disability)</td>
      <td><span data-field="disability.last_day_worked">{{ disability.last_day_worked }}</span></td>
      <td>Date first treated by Physician</td>
      <td><span data-field="disability.date_first_treated">{{ disability.date_first_treated }}</span></td>
      <td>Date expected to return to work</td>
      <td><span data-field="disability.expected_return_date">{{ disability.expected_return_date }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Did you require Emergency Room care for your condition?</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> Yes</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> No</td>
      <td>Date (mm/dd/yyyy)</td>
      <td><span data-field="disability.er_date">{{ disability.er_date }}</span></td>
      <td>Hospital phone number</td>
      <td><span data-field="disability.er_hospital_phone">{{ disability.er_hospital_phone }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Were you confined to a hospital for this condition?</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> Yes</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> No</td>
      <td>Date(s) of confinement (mm/dd/yyyy) From:</td>
      <td><span data-field="disability.confinement_from">{{ disability.confinement_from }}</span></td>
      <td>To:</td>
      <td><span data-field="disability.confinement_to">{{ disability.confinement_to }}</span></td>
      <td>Hospital phone number</td>
      <td><span data-field="disability.confinement_hospital_phone">{{ disability.confinement_hospital_phone }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div class="section-title">Select the appropriate type of condition, and provide details:</div>
  <div style="display: flex; gap: 40px;">
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 20px;">
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Motor vehicle accident</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Attached accident report with this statement</label>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 20px;">
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Pregnancy</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Complications</label>
    </div>
  </div>

  <table>
    <tr>
      <td>Expected due date (mm/dd/yyyy)</td>
      <td><span data-field="disability.expected_due_date">{{ disability.expected_due_date }}</span></td>
      <td>Actual delivery date (mm/dd/yyyy)</td>
      <td><span data-field="disability.actual_delivery_date">{{ disability.actual_delivery_date }}</span></td>
      <td>Delivery type</td>
      <td><input type="radio" name="delivery_type" value="Normal"> Normal</td>
      <td><input type="radio" name="delivery_type" value="C-Section"> C-Section</td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <div class="section-title">Work-related injury/sickness</div>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td>Date of first symptom/injury (mm/dd/yyyy):</td>
      <td><span data-field="disability.injury_date">{{ disability.injury_date }}</span></td>
      <td>Where occurred:</td>
      <td><span data-field="disability.injury_location">{{ disability.injury_location }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Cause of injury/sickness:</td>
      <td><span data-field="disability.injury_cause">{{ disability.injury_cause }}</span></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td></td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> Yes</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> No</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Do you intend to file for Workers' Compensation?</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> Denied</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> Approved</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> Pending</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> Appealed</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Sickness</td>
      <td>Date of first symptom (mm/dd/yyyy):</td>
      <td><span data-field="disability.sickness_date">{{ disability.sickness_date }}</span></td>
      <td>Type of sickness</td>
      <td><span data-field="disability.sickness_type">{{ disability.sickness_type }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Have you experienced symptoms in the past?</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> Yes</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> No</td>
      <td>If "Yes", provide the date</td>
      <td><span data-field="disability.past_symptoms_date">{{ disability.past_symptoms_date }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="section-title">3 Other income information</div>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt;">If you receive other income, please provide us with any approval/denial letters.</p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <td style="width: 30%;">Source of Income</td>
        <td style="width: 20%;">Weekly</td>
        <td style="width: 20%;">Monthly</td>
        <td style="width: 30%;">Payment Amount</td>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>Sick Pay</td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td>$ <span data-field="other_income.sick_pay_amount">{{ other_income.sick_pay_amount }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Salary Continuance</td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td>$ <span data-field="other_income.salary_continuance_amount">{{ other_income.salary_continuance_amount }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>State Disability</td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td>$ <span data-field="other_income.state_disability_amount">{{ other_income.state_disability_amount }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Workers' Compensation</td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td>$ <span data-field="other_income.workers_comp_amount">{{ other_income.workers_comp_amount }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Unemployment</td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td>$ <span data-field="other_income.unemployment_amount">{{ other_income.unemployment_amount }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Social Security Disability</td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td>$ <span data-field="other_income.ssdi_amount">{{ other_income.ssdi_amount }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Disability/Retirement Pension</td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td>$ <span data-field="other_income.pension_amount">{{ other_income.pension_amount }}</span></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>Other:</td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td><input type="checkbox"></td>
        <td>$ <span data-field="other_income.other_amount">{{ other_income.other_amount }}</span></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="section-title">4 Education, Training, and Experience</div>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt;">Please indicate the highest level of education you have completed</p>
  <div style="display: flex; gap: 30px; margin-bottom: 15px;">
    <label><input type="checkbox"> Less than High School Grade (Grade: <span data-field="education.less_than_high_school_grade">{{ education.less_than_high_school_grade }}</span>)</label>
    <label><input type="checkbox"> High School (GED)</label>
    <label><input type="checkbox"> College</label>
  </div>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td>Name of school / college</td>
      <td><span data-field="education.school_name">{{ education.school_name }}</span></td>
      <td>Dates attended</td>
      <td><span data-field="education.dates_attended">{{ education.dates_attended }}</span></td>
      <td>Field of study</td>
      <td><span data-field="education.field_of_study">{{ education.field_of_study }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p style="font-size: 11pt;">Sun Life believes that work is healthy and we hope that we can help you get safely back to work. Please contact us if you have questions about our return to work services and incentives.</p>

  <div style="margin-top: 20px;">
    <p style="font-size: 11pt;">1. Since you became disabled, have you acquired, or do you plan to acquire any additional education or training?</p>
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 30px;">
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Yes</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> No</label>
    </div>
    <p style="font-size: 11pt;">2. Are you working or have you worked at any time since you became disabled?</p>
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 30px;">
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Yes</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> No</label>
    </div>
    <p style="font-size: 11pt;">If "Yes," please describe.</p>
    <div style="height: 60px; border: 1px solid #ccc; margin-top: 5px;"></div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">Military Experience</div>
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td>Did you serve in the armed forces?</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> Yes</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> No</td>
      <td>Branch</td>
      <td><span data-field="military.branch">{{ military.branch }}</span></td>
      <td>Highest rank</td>
      <td><span data-field="military.highest_rank">{{ military.highest_rank }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Dates of service (mm/dd/yyyy) From:</td>
      <td><span data-field="military.service_from">{{ military.service_from }}</span></td>
      <td>To:</td>
      <td><span data-field="military.service_to">{{ military.service_to }}</span></td>
      <td>Specialty</td>
      <td><span data-field="military.specialty">{{ military.specialty }}</span></td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p style="font-size: 11pt;">If you have a resume, please include a copy. You may use this section to indicate any additional experience.</p>

  <div class="section-title">Prior Work Experience</div>
  {% for job in work_experience %}
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Name of employer</td>
      <td><span data-field="work_experience[{{ loop.index0 }}].employer_name">{{ job.employer_name }}</span></td>
      <td>Title</td>
      <td><span data-field="work_experience[{{ loop.index0 }}].title">{{ job.title }}</span></td>
      <td>Dates of employment (mm/dd/yyyy) From:</td>
      <td><span data-field="work_experience[{{ loop.index0 }}].start_date">{{ job.start_date }}</span></td>
      <td>To:</td>
      <td><span data-field="work_experience[{{ loop.index0 }}].end_date">{{ job.end_date }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td colspan="8">Tasks and duties (please be specific)</td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td colspan="8" style="height: 40px; border: 1px solid #ccc;"></td>
    </tr>
  </table>
  {% endfor %}

  <div class="section-title">Computer Skills</div>
  <div style="display: flex; gap: 40px;">
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 20px;">
      <label>Are you: <input type="radio" name="hand_preference" value="Left-handed"> Left-handed</label>
      <label>Right-handed</label>
      <label>Computer keyboard familiarity:</label>
      <label><input type="radio" name="kb_familiarity" value="None"> None</label>
      <label><input type="radio" name="kb_familiarity" value="Basic"> Basic</label>
      <label><input type="radio" name="kb_familiarity" value="Proficient"> Proficient</label>
    </div>
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 20px;">
      <label>Do you have a computer?</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Yes</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> No</label>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="margin-top: 15px;">
    <p>Do you use:</p>
    <div style="display: flex; gap: 30px;">
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Word Processing software</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> E-mail</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Internet</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Excel</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Powerpoint</label>
      <label><input type="checkbox"> Other:</label>
      <td><span data-field="computer_other_software">{{ computer_other_software }}</span></td>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div class="section-title">5 Physician information</div>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt;">List physicians you are seeing or have seen for this condition.</p>
  {% for physician in physicians %}
  <table>
    <tr>
      <td style="width: 30%;">Name of physician</td>
      <td><span data-field="physician[{{ loop.index0 }}].name">{{ physician.name }}</span></td>
      <td>Specialty</td>
      <td><span data-field="physician[{{ loop.index0 }}].specialty">{{ physician.specialty }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Address</td>
      <td><span data-field="physician[{{ loop.index0 }}].address">{{ physician.address }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Phone number</td>
      <td><span data-field="physician[{{ loop.index0 }}].phone">{{ physician.phone }}</span></td>
      <td>Fax number</td>
      <td><span data-field="physician[{{ loop.index0 }}].fax">{{ physician.fax }}</span></td>
      <td>Date of last visit (mm/dd/yyyy)</td>
      <td><span data-field="physician[{{ loop.index0 }}].last_visit_date">{{ physician.last_visit_date }}</span></td>
      <td>Date of next visit (mm/dd/yyyy)</td>
      <td><span data-field="physician[{{ loop.index0 }}].next_visit_date">{{ physician.next_visit_date }}</span></td>
    </tr>
    <tr>
      <td>Have you discussed a return to work plan with this physician?</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> Yes</td>
      <td><input type="checkbox"> No</td>
    </tr>
  </table>
  {% endfor %}

  <p style="font-size: 11pt;">If you need more room, check here and attach a separate sheet.</p>

  <div class="section-title">6 Signature</div>
  <p style="font-size: 11pt;">I certify that the above statements are true and complete. I have read or had read to me the fraud warning for my state.</p>
  <div class="signature-line">
    <div>
      Employee's signature
      <div style="height: 50px; border-bottom: 1px solid black; margin-top: 5px;"></div>
    </div>
    <div>
      Date signed (mm/dd/yyyy)
      <div style="height: 50px; border-bottom: 1px solid black; margin-top: 5px;"></div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="section-title">7 Fraud warnings</div>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">General fraud warning: Any person who knowingly and with intent to defraud any insurance company or other person files an application for insurance or statement of claim containing any materially false information or conceals for the purpose of misleading, information concerning any fact material thereto commits a fraudulent insurance act, which is a crime and subjects such person to criminal and civil penalties.</p>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">A: Any person who knowingly and with intent to injure, defraud, or deceive an insurance company files a claim containing any materially false information or conceals for the purpose of misleading, information concerning any fact material thereto commits a fraudulent insurance act, which is a crime and subjects such person to criminal and civil penalties.</p>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">AR, LA, MA, MN, TX and WV: Any person who knowingly presents a false or fraudulent claim for payment of a loss or benefit or knowingly presents false information in an application for insurance is guilty of a crime and may be subject to restitution fines or confinement in prison.</p>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">AZ: For your protection Arizona law requires the following statement to appear on this form. Any person who knowingly presents a false or fraudulent claim for payment of a loss is subject to criminal and civil penalties.</p>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">CA: For your protection California law requires the following to appear on this form. Any person who knowingly presents a false or fraudulent claim for the payment of a loss is guilty of a crime and may be subject to fines and confinement in state prison.</p>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">CO: It is unlawful to knowingly provide false, incomplete, or misleading facts or information to an insurance company for the purpose of defrauding or attempting to defraud the company. Penalties may include imprisonment, fines, denial of insurance and civil damages.</p>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">CT: Any insurance company or agent who knowingly provides false, incomplete, or misleading facts or information to a policyholder or claimant for the purpose of defrauding or attempting to defraud the company, or any person who knowingly provides false, incomplete, or misleading facts or information to an insurance company or agent, is guilty of a crime and may be subject to criminal and civil penalties.</p>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">DC: Any person who knowingly presents a false or fraudulent claim for payment of a loss or benefit or knowingly presents false information in an application for insurance is guilty of a crime and may be subject to fines and confinement in prison.</p>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">DE: Any person who knowingly presents a false or fraudulent claim for payment of a loss or benefit or knowingly presents false information in an application for insurance is guilty of a crime and may be subject to fines and confinement in prison.</p>
  <p style="font-size: 10pt;">ME: It is a crime to knowingly provide false, incomplete or misleading information to an insurance company for the purpose of defrauding the company. Penalties include imprisonment, fines and denial of insurance benefits.</p>
